Chapter: FishTankWasm
  cites Foreword chapter List
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Fish tank domain logic compiled to WASM. Exports functions that
 the JS bridge calls: species count, species properties, body
 profile stations, boids update, particle update, init, tick.

 All values scaled by 100 for positions/velocities, 1000 for
 angles/alpha/size. Integer arithmetic only (no floats in Codex).

Section: Species Data

  species-count : Integer = 8

  species-name : Integer -> Text
  species-name (i) =
    if i == 0 then "Clownfish"
    else if i == 1 then "Angelfish"
    else if i == 2 then "Neon Tetra"
    else if i == 3 then "Blue Tang"
    else if i == 4 then "Discus"
    else if i == 5 then "Guppy"
    else if i == 6 then "Seahorse"
    else "Shrimp"

  species-tex : Integer -> Text
  species-tex (i) =
    if i == 0 then "fish-clownfish"
    else if i == 1 then "fish-angelfish"
    else if i == 2 then "fish-neontetra"
    else if i == 3 then "fish-tang"
    else if i == 4 then "fish-discus"
    else if i == 5 then "fish-guppy"
    else if i == 6 then "creature-seahorse"
    else "creature-shrimp"

